  tierReadouts:
  - TierLabel: LV1 Body Block
    StageRole: Short vanguard entry that brings an actual guard screen before answering
      once.
    PlayerUse: Spend if the player is cornered near the backline and needs breathing
      room.
    SummonRead: FinalStandCommander enters right of the lane and pushes toward the
      frontline with a body-and-screen block.
  - TierLabel: LV2 Hold Line
    StageRole: Tankier frontline actor that can absorb a small boss curtain before
      counterfire.
    PlayerUse: Hold EN when the next boss pressure wave is readable but dense.
    SummonRead: FinalStandCommander advances until contested, holds a four-hit screen,
      then fires two heavy bolts.
  - TierLabel: LV3 Break Wall
    StageRole: High-cost vanguard actor and screen for stabilizing a bad exchange
      and forcing a counter window.
    PlayerUse: Save for the committed boss pattern that would otherwise push the
      player back.
    SummonRead: FinalStandCommander drives into the frontline with a seven-hit screen
      and heavy three-shot response.
